nment and the focus  for that wish is here the federal  Parliament or bundestag it was once  called the reichstag back in the time of  the Kaisers in 2020 hundreds of  far-right activists tried to storm the  building during an anti-lockdown  demonstration that failed stopping that  action involved a few hundred police  forming a cordon around it stopping this  alleged coup d'etat has involved  thousands more officers operating right  across the country Dominic Kane Al  Jazeera Berlin
 

